# ============================================================
# BOVIX — Environment Configuration Template
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to .env and replace values with your Firebase
# project credentials. Use the appropriate .env.<env> file for
# each environment (production, test, backup).
# ============================================================

# Environment identifier — one of: production | test | backup
EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=test

# Firebase Configuration (Replace with your Firebase project credentials)
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=api_key_here
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=bovix-dairy-app.firebaseapp.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=bovix-dairy-app
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=bovix-dairy-app.firebasestorage.app
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=id_here
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=id